{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an epic adventure to defend your kingdom against the relentless goblin invasion and their haunting spirits, using every troop and tower at your disposal to crush the enemy forces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend villages, forests, and the heart of the realm through dynamic weather conditions like harsh winters, torrential rains, fierce storms, and challenging night battles that will put your tactics to the test. Adapt your strategy with each encounter and prepare to strike back by venturing into the goblin lands to claim your vengeance and uncover the ancient secret they guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your defenses, plan your strategy, command your troops, and upgrade everything after each battle in this thrilling journey to protect the Kingdom from the goblin menace!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754360?t=1768895204","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754360?t=1768895204","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754360/ab754a70b4191a35e28106482934ff6427ad0325/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768895204","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754360/ab754a70b4191a35e28106482934ff6427ad0325/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768895204","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3776100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an epic adventure to defen